Bind Npc 24439 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 14439 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 523 "[Descendant of Hero] Unidentified Attacker"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Sage of Eslant] Pablo."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Sage of Eslant] Agatha."

Requires player level >= 60 and quest 522 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Eslant Wise Man]Pablo needs to be alerted! To go to Eslant go to the entrance and take the portal!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Eslant Wise Man]Agata needs to be alerted! To go to Eslant go to the entrance and take the portal!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Who are you? What? Are you here for errands?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "So much for b a [Captain]... Let's see a monster right? There are so many monsters in Eslant, I have no idea which one it is.\n\nTalk to Pablo to serve the order of [Captain] Fargo."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Who are you? What? Are you here for errands?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "So much for b a [Captain]... Let's see a monster right? There are so many monsters in Eslant, I have no idea which one it is.\n\nTalk to Agatha to serve the order of [Captain] Falkwine."

On claimable
    Show quest "Let's see, they attacked at night and dislike noise... They might be ... I have some in mind. Go and warm up before I make up my mind."
